| Telephony cost per minute | `--telephony-per-min` | Inbound minutes, including forwarding legs | **FAKE, VERIFY** |
| Speech-to-text per minute | `--stt-per-min` | Turning the caller's speech into text | **FAKE, VERIFY** |
